# Butler Routes - Darkshore completionist pilot (pack butler-routes-completionist, v0.8.0).
# Every Darkshore quest in the local census (74 quests, docs/darkshore-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin.
# No race header: the data leaves open quests to all Alliance and gates only
# the Night Elf return (6343), the Human/Dwarf Warrior stop (1442) and the
# Night Elf Druid pair (6123/6124), so per-line `only` gates carry the rest.
# Chain order is strictly turn-in-before-accept (external pres become notes
# plus listed structural warnings, or when onquest mini-steps where completes
# would wedge the sim); item- and object-started quests never wedge (note at
# the source, sourcing optional); elites get notes, not silent solos.
# Coordinates use the era frame the data carries, set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/darkshore
title Darkshore - Completionist
levels 10-20
zone Darkshore
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords darkshore, completionist, auberdine, tower of althalaxx, beached
coords live
version 1

step Auberdine - landfall

  zone map 1439

  tip Auberdine, the port hub. Laird (36.8, 44.3) holds the boat line; Terenthis (39.4, 43.5) and Tharnariun (38.8, 43.4) keep the town quests; Glynda (37.7, 43.4) posts the boards and the Red Crystal; Wizbang (37.0, 44.1) runs the buzzboxes; Gwennyth (36.6, 45.6) walks the shore; Gorbold (38.1, 41.2) wants the deeps; Cerellean (35.7, 43.7) mourns; Alanndarian (37.7, 40.7) keeps the grove word and the cooking pot; Elissa (39.1, 43.6) watches the Tower; Hollee (37.4, 41.8) digs. Thundris (37.4, 40.1) stands just east. Take every quest in town before you head out.
  note Return to Nessa (6343) sends Laird's word back to Nessa at Rut'theran across the water; hop the boat back, turn in at the dock, sail home. The route never strands it.
  accept 6343 only NightElf -- Return to Nessa - Laird; Nessa's word at Rut'theran
  zone map 1438
  turnin 6343 only NightElf -- Return to Nessa - Laird's word to Nessa Shadowsong
  zone map 1439
  accept 984 -- How Big a Threat? - Terenthis; find a corrupt furbolg camp
  accept 985 -- How Big a Threat? - Terenthis; eight Pathfinders and five Windtalkers
  accept 986 -- A Lost Master - Terenthis; five Fine Moonstalker Pelts
  accept 993 -- A Lost Master - Terenthis; carry the word south to Volcor
  accept 2118 -- Plagued Lands - Tharnariun Treetender; a Rabid Thistle Bear
  accept 2138 -- Cleansing of the Infected - Tharnariun Treetender; twenty Rabid Thistle Bears
  accept 983 -- Buzzbox 827 - Wizbang Cranktoggle; six Crawler Legs
  complete 983 @34.7,48.0 era -- six Crawler Legs off the Pygmy Tide Crawlers on the town shore
  turnin 983 -- Buzzbox 827 - the legs to Wizbang Cranktoggle
  accept 1001 -- Buzzbox 411 - Buzzbox 827; carry the word north
  note Gaffer Jacks (1579) and Electropellers (1580) want eight Gaffer Jacks and twelve Electropellers; the data lists no Darkshore source, so have them in your bags (auction house or an engineer) before you turn in.
  accept 1579 -- Gaffer Jacks - Wizbang Cranktoggle; eight Gaffer Jacks
  accept 947 -- Cave Mushrooms - Barithras Moonshade; Scaber Stalks and a Death Cap
  accept 965 -- The Tower of Althalaxx - Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze; Balthule waits north
  accept 982 -- Deep Ocean, Vast Sea - Gorbold Steelhand; the two lockboxes
  accept 2178 -- Easy Strider Living - Alanndarian Nightsong; five Strider Meat

step Tower of Althalaxx - the north

  zone map 1439

  tip North up the coast: Gelkak's camp, the two lockboxes, the buzzbox relay, the Tower and its mushrooms, and the Baron's waters. Athrikus Narassin (56.0, 26.3) is an elite - bring help or outlevel him.
  turnin 965 -- The Tower of Althalaxx - Elissa's word to Balthule Shadowstrike
  accept 966 -- The Tower of Althalaxx - Balthule Shadowstrike; four Worn Parchments
  complete 966 @55.0,27.7 era -- four Worn Parchments off the Dark Strand Fanatics by the Tower
  turnin 966 -- The Tower of Althalaxx - the parchments to Balthule Shadowstrike
  accept 967 -- The Tower of Althalaxx - Balthule Shadowstrike; Delgren waits in Ashenvale
  complete 947 @55.6,35.0 era -- five Scaber Stalks and the Death Cap around the Tower slopes
  accept 2098 -- Gyromast's Retrieval - Gelkak Gyromast; the three key parts
  complete 982 @38.2,28.8 era -- Silver Dawning's Lockbox on the north shore
  complete 982 @39.6,27.5 era -- Mist Veil's Lockbox further east
  note Baron Marinous (98028) starts from the Clouded Water Globe the Baron carries on the far north-east shore (57.6, 20.8); the Baron is an elite. Take the globe if it drops, hand it to Onu in the south; the route never waits on it.
  accept 98028 -- Baron Marinous - the Clouded Water Globe
  accept 1143 -- The Tower of Althalaxx - Balthule Shadowstrike; Athrikus Narassin's Head
  turnin 1143 -- The Tower of Althalaxx - the Head to Balthule Shadowstrike
  accept 981 -- The Tower of Althalaxx - Balthule Shadowstrike; Delgren waits in Ashenvale

