step Auberdine - first returns

  zone map 1439

  tip Back through town on the way south: bank the north trip, pick up the Bashal'Aran follow-ups at Thundris's, and take Barithras's word for Onu.
  turnin 982 -- Deep Ocean, Vast Sea - the lockboxes to Gorbold Steelhand
  turnin 947 -- Cave Mushrooms - the mushrooms to Barithras Moonshade
  accept 948 -- Onu - Barithras Moonshade; Onu waits in the southern grove
  turnin 1579 -- Gaffer Jacks - the jacks to Wizbang Cranktoggle
  accept 1580 -- Electropellers - Wizbang Cranktoggle; twelve Electropellers
  turnin 1580 -- Electropellers - the electropellers to Wizbang Cranktoggle
  accept 3524 -- Washed Ashore - Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde; Sea Creature Bones
  accept 963 -- For Love Eternal - Cerellean Whiteclaw; Anaya's Pendant
  note Fruit of the Sea (1138) wants six Fine Crab Chunks off the tide crawlers; The Family and the Fishing Pole (1141) wants six Darkshore Grouper - fished or bought.
  accept 1138 -- Fruit of the Sea - Gubber Blump; six Fine Crab Chunks
  accept 1141 -- The Family and the Fishing Pole - Gubber Blump; six Darkshore Grouper
  note WANTED: Murkdeep! (4740) is posted on the board by the dock (37.2, 44.2); Murkdeep works the north-west shore (36.4, 76.5). Take it if you pass; the route never waits on a rare spawn.
  accept 4740 -- WANTED: Murkdeep! - the board; Murkdeep on the north-west shore
  note Washed Ashore (4681) needs Bones (3524) turned in first - Gwennyth's turnin below unlocks it.
  accept 4681 -- Washed Ashore - Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde; Sea Turtle Remains

step West coast - south to the Grove

  zone map 1439

  tip Down the west shore: the furbolg camp, the bears, Tysha's ruins, the pelts, the bones, and Murkdeep. Grell Earrings and Moonstalker Fangs come off anything in the way. The beached pair here unlocks with 4681's turnin - re-click stragglers on the last loop.
  complete 984 @39.9,53.9 era -- find the corrupt furbolg camp
  complete 2118 @38.1,56.6 era -- the Rabid Thistle Bear
  complete 2138 @38.1,56.6 era -- twenty Rabid Thistle Bears along the road
  complete 3524 @36.4,50.9 era -- Sea Creature Bones at the beached wreck
  accept 953 -- The Fall of Ameth'Aran - Sentinel Tysha Moonblade; read the tablets east
  accept 4722 -- Beached Sea Turtle - the beached turtle (37.1, 62.2)
  accept 4728 -- Beached Sea Creature - the beached creature (36.0, 70.9)
  complete 2098 @35.7,71.6 era -- the Middle of Gelkak's Key off the Greymist Coastrunners and Seers
  complete 1001 @29.5,46.3 era -- three Thresher Eyes off the Darkshore Threshers
  complete 1138 @34.9,72.3 era -- six Fine Crab Chunks off the Reef Crawlers
  complete 4740 @36.4,76.5 era -- Murkdeep on the north-west shore (elite - bring help or outlevel him)

