step Auberdine - south chain returns

  zone map 1439

  tip Back up to town with the coast's leavings: the furbolg and bear words, the bones, and - with 4681 turned in - the whole beached series unlocks for the way south. Swing east to Thundris for his errands.
  turnin 984 -- How Big a Threat? - the camp word to Terenthis
  accept 4761 -- Thundris Windweaver - Terenthis; Thundris waits east
  turnin 4761 -- Thundris Windweaver - Terenthis's word to Thundris Windweaver
  accept 4762 -- The Cliffspring River - Thundris Windweaver; the river sample
  turnin 2118 -- Plagued Lands - the bear to Tharnariun Treetender
  turnin 2138 -- Cleansing of the Infected - the bears to Tharnariun Treetender
  accept 2139 -- Tharnariun's Hope - Tharnariun Treetender; Den Mother in the east
  turnin 3524 -- Washed Ashore - the bones to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  turnin 4681 -- Washed Ashore - the remains to Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  accept 954 -- Bashal'Aran - Thundris Windweaver; the blue aura in the ruins
  accept 958 -- Tools of the Highborne - Thundris Windweaver; seven Highborne Relics
  accept 4811 -- The Red Crystal - Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea; the eastern crystal
  note Trouble In Darkshore? (730, Teldrassil) unlocks The Absent Minded Prospector (729) here; Greywhisker's word in Teldrassil comes first, then Hollee's dig takes the story south.
  accept 729 -- The Absent Minded Prospector - Archaeologist Hollee; carry the word to Remtravel
  note Seeking the Kor Gem (1442) follows an Ironforge Paladin chain (1654, uncontracted); the gem itself waits at the far south of the zone. Human and Dwarf Paladins only.
  accept 1442 only Human,Dwarf,Paladin -- Seeking the Kor Gem - Thundris Windweaver; the Corrupted Kor Gem
  note Researching the Corruption (1275) needs The Corruption Abroad (3765, Azshara) first - out of contract, so the errand waits on that trip.
  accept 1275 -- Researching the Corruption - Gershala Nightwhisper; eight Corrupted Brain Stems
  note Unrequited Love (98461) carries Hollee's word to Tarrel in the Wetlands; sail east when the zone is done.
  accept 98461 -- Unrequited Love - Archaeologist Hollee; Hollee's word for Tarrel
  note Gathering the Cure (6123) needs The Principal Source (6122, Moonglade) turned in first; pick it up from Dendrite in Moonglade before Alanndarian's cure counts. The route never wedges on it.
  note Earthroot comes from any herbalist or vendor; Lunar Fungus blooms south-east of town.
  accept 6123 only NightElf,Druid -- Gathering the Cure - Alanndarian Nightsong; Earthroot and Lunar Fungus
  accept 6124 only NightElf,Druid -- Curing the Sick - Alanndarian Nightsong; the Sickly Deer

step Far south - Volcor, escorts and the Blackfathom

  zone map 1439

  tip The far south: the last beached pair, Volcor's cave, Therylune's flight, both southern escorts, and the Blackfathom shore. Corrupted Brain Stems and the Kor Gem come off the satyrs and naga down here. The beached four here are open now that 4681 is turned in. Den Mother and the buzzbox wait for the return trip.
