step The last miles - Den Mother, the crystal and the buzzbox

  zone map 1439

  tip One last loop, and it rambles: north-east for the Rod, east for Den Mother and the crystal, south for fangs, back to the 323 box, south again for scalps and the 525 box, then home by way of Onu and Arbal. Den Mother is an elite - bring help or outlevel her. Re-click any beached stragglers still in your log on the way.
  accept 4813 -- The Fragments Within - the Mysterious Red Crystal (47.3, 48.7)
  complete 2139 @51.5,38.3 era -- Den Mother in the east
  complete 1002 @37.5,63.4 era -- six Moonstalker Fangs off the Moonstalkers, back south
